	(text "06_CURRENT_FRONTEND_ADC — Gate F detailed: ADS1262 (supply corrected: compare +2.5V VCM vs ±2.5V bipolar direct GND-centered; PREFER bipolar ±2.5V for 100nA low-leakage, see DEC-039)IPW TSSOP-28 PW (was TQFP-28, SBAS661C) re-derived (VREF 2.5, PGA 1-32, FSR=±VREF/G, AIN 0.3..4.7V, PGAL_ALM)" (at 9.91 5.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
	(text "Chain: ISENSE_P/N_K → R_prot 1k + BAV199 3pA typical (max nA at VR=75V, not guaranteed) — PRIMARY 1uA/100nA clamp AFTER OPA140 buffer, pre-buffer BAV199 DNP/prototype (leakage must not load shunt)(3pA) clamp (NO TVS) → RC 1k+10n C0G (8kHz diff) → Buffer → VCM=2.5V shift → 1k+1n → AIN0/1 (PGAL/H monitor)" (at 9.91 7.87 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "Buffers: ADA4522 (<5uV, 50pA) for 2.5R-5k (10mA-10uA) + OPA140 (0.5pA typ, 10pA max JFET) for 100k/1M (1uA/100nA) — <10pA audit 7.5pA typ" (at 9.91 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "PGA table: 10mA/1mA 25mV→PGA32 FS78mV 32% (preGain 3.13 DNP) | 100uA/10uA 50mV→PGA32 64% (1.56 DNP) | 1uA/100nA 100mV→PGA16 FS156 64% (*PGA32 clips*)" (at 9.91 83.06 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "External gain: NOT mandatory — PGA covers FS with 1.56-3.13x headroom. Hybrid amp needed for LEVEL SHIFT (0V→2.5V VCM) + leakage isolation (ADC 2nA bias cannot drive 1M)" (at 9.91 86.11 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "REF: LTC6655-2.5 LN REFP/REFN 10u+100n. AVDD 5V AVSS 0V (0.3 cushion) DVDD 3V3. AINCOM=2.5V from divider. DRDY/status PGAL/H flag checked. No TVS on high-Z — BAV199 3pA typical (max nA at VR=75V, not guaranteed) — PRIMARY 1uA/100nA clamp AFTER OPA140 buffer, pre-buffer BAV199 DNP/prototype (leakage must not load shunt) only." (at 9.91 88.90 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "LAYOUT: BAV199 3pA typical (max nA at VR=75V, not guaranteed) — PRIMARY 1uA/100nA clamp AFTER OPA140 buffer, pre-buffer BAV199 DNP/prototype (leakage must not load shunt) + RC + buffers adjacent, guard keepout on OPA140 inputs (exposed ring, 0.5mm gap, stitched inner plane DNP, local 100n). R_prot before clamp, RC after." (at 9.91 91.95 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))
	(text "RE-DERIVED per TI SBAS661C Eq12/Table7-1: |FSR|=VREF/G, 0.3<=AIN<=4.7, VCM=2.5 +/- G*Vdiff/2 <0.3/4.7 — compliant for all 6 shunts. See docs/calculations/ADS1262 (supply corrected: compare +2.5V VCM vs ±2.5V bipolar direct GND-centered; PREFER bipolar ±2.5V for 100nA low-leakage, see DEC-039)IPW TSSOP-28 PW (was TQFP-28, SBAS661C)_ANALOG_RANGE_DERIVATION.md" (at 9.91 95.00 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left)))

